{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17212350","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17212350","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1721235001:1":{"text":"啊呀！这不是王子殿下身边的……呃……那谁谁吗！好久不见啊！","source_cn":"啊呀！这不是王子殿下身边的……呃……那谁谁吗！好久不见啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3577FD0E8BD152CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1721235002:1":{"text":"是有什么我葛朗台能为王子殿下效劳的吗？","source_cn":"是有什么我葛朗台能为王子殿下效劳的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38C2277D170730CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1721235003:1":{"text":"葛朗台男爵，这是殿下让我带给您的邀请函。","source_cn":"葛朗台男爵，这是殿下让我带给您的邀请函。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B86A13342FE3F9E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:5::0":{"text":"邀请函","source_cn":"邀请函","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x83DB9B00687538B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1721235004:1":{"text":"奥利安殿下听闻了整件事的前因后果。尽管霓光鲤未能起效，但葛朗台男爵一片忠心仍然值得感念。","source_cn":"奥利安殿下听闻了整件事的前因后果。尽管霓光鲤未能起效，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE5CC15CAF3E77BE7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"s